# The version to publish as a GitHub Release.
#
# Changing this file and pushing is what starts the Windows desktop build in
# .github/workflows/desktop.yml. It builds the installer and the zip on a
# Windows runner and publishes them under this version, tagged `v<version>`.
#
# Keep it equal to the version in package.json — the artifacts are named from
# package.json, and the release notes point at those names by filename. The
# workflow checks and fails if the two disagree.
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored; the first line left is the
# version.

0.1.0
